  "description": "The transcripts of Multilingual TEDx for its eight monolingual archives: one instance for each language, each record being a segment of a talk with its identifier, text, talk, audio file, start, end, duration and split. The archives of translation pairs repeat the source language's transcripts beside a translation, and the IWSLT 2021 test sets are not read. It carries none of the audio, which the download list of openslr-slr100 gives.",
